  "description": "HONOLULU — A mariner in distress was rescued by a container vessel in the North Pacific at 9 p.m. Monday. \r\n\r\nThe crew aboard the container vessel Kota Wangi rescued a 58-year-old Australian mariner aboard the sailing vessel Folly II. The mariner was in good condition and was transiting from California to Christmas Island, in the Republic of Kiribati, when the vessel’s autopilot reportedly failed.  Also available in High Definition.",
